+- GNU Bash 5.3.9 (`/opt/homebrew/bin/bash`); scripts remain compatible with macOS `/bin/bash` 3.2 syntax.
+- Apple Git 2.50.1 (`/usr/bin/git`).
+- Apple Swift 6.3.2 (`/usr/bin/swift`), target `arm64-apple-macosx26.0`.
+- GNU Make 3.81 (`/usr/bin/make`).
+- Apple `plutil` and `/usr/libexec/PlistBuddy` for plist inspection.
+- `shasum` 6.02 for SHA-256 validation.
